name: samus
---
Cinematic, hyper-detailed, full-body shot of adult Samus Aran, whithout her helmet, exposing her beautiful face and long blond hair, standing confidently in a high-security, sprawling extraterrestrial research laboratory. She wears a heavily modified, battle-scarred Power Suit, intricately layered with metallic plating and integrated glowing cyan energy veins. The armor is deliberately cut extremely low, exposing a deep, dramatic cleavage and her medium, soft, glistening breasts straining against the thin, tactical undersuit. A massive, bioluminescent Metroid floats menacingly behind her, encased in a translucent membrane, its internal green nuclei pulsing rhythmically as suggestive, semi-sentient tendrils subtly brush against her armor. The lab environment is a masterpiece of high-tech design: banks of holographic displays, complex machinery, cryogenic containment cylinders, and advanced scientific instrumentation dominate the background. The lighting is intensely dramatic, dominated by cold, electric blues, sharp lens flares, and deep, velvety shadows that carve out her powerful physique and the intricate details of her suit. Extreme textural detail on the worn metal, wetness on her skin, and a palpable sense of danger and intense sexual tension. Volumetric fog, depth of field, cyberpunk aesthetic, octane render, cinematic color grading (teal and crimson), Hasselblad medium format, 85mm lens, masterpiece quality, intricate costume design, highly sexualized, gritty sci-fi concept art, Greg Rutkowski influence.